# This directory holds local data files used by the chatbot at runtime.
#
# Examples of what belongs here:
#   - Raw documents to be ingested (PDF, TXT, Markdown)
#   - ChromaDB persistent vector store (created automatically at first run)
#   - Any other application-specific data files
#
# The directory itself is tracked in git (via this README) but its contents
# are excluded by .gitignore entries for *.db, chroma/, etc.
